<http://data.silknow.org/object/9e729f53-76a4-3284-bc3c-2ff2301ed615/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Lacis, silk net embroidered with silk with an added silk fringe.\nHand-made dark red silk net.  On four sides there is a narrow border with squares each containing 4 smaller squares of grey and white, with a chevron line in dark red and light beige either side. The central field has a small lozenge lattice in white and details in light blue.\nThere is a black silk fringe from a woven heading."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/9e729f53-76a4-3284-bc3c-2ff2301ed615> .

